  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong>  </span>has released the Result of Joint Entrance Examination ( JEE Advanced) 2026 on the official website. Applications for the IIT JEE Advanced Application Form 2026 were accepted from 23 April 2026, to 02 May 2026. The written examination was Conducted from 17 May 2026. Candidates who had appeared in this Examination can download their IIT JEE Advanced Result 2026 from the link given below.</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Indian Institute of Technology (IIT Roorkee)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">IIT JEE Advanced Result 2026</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>23 April 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <strong>02 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>04 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Exam Date :&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>17 May 2026</strong></span></span></div>\n</li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Admit Card Available : <strong>11 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li>\n<div>Question Paper :&nbsp;<strong>21&nbsp;May 2026</strong></div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidate responses &nbsp;:<strong> 25-26 May 2026</strong></span></div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Answer Key :<strong> 25 May 2026</strong></span></div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Answer Key Objection :<strong> 25-26 May 2026&nbsp;</strong></span></div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Final Answer Key :<strong> 01 June 2026</strong></span></div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Result Available on :&nbsp;<strong>01 June 2025</strong></span></div>\n</li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Score Card : <strong>01 June 2026</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">General, OBC : <strong>Rs.</strong> <b>3200/-&nbsp;</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">SC, ST, PH : <strong>Rs.</strong> <b>1600/-&nbsp;</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">All Category Female :&nbsp;<strong>Rs. 1600/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Pay the Examination Fee Through Debit Card, Credit Card, Net Banking, E Challan, E Wallet, Cash Card Fee Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspa