nline Form 2026 : </strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Selection will be based on </span>Entrance Test.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How To Download IIT JEE Advanced Result 2026</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Open on the region wise&nbsp;<strong>Download Result</strong>&nbsp;link from the&nbsp;<strong>Important Links&nbsp;</strong>box placed below.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates will be redirected to a new page.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">In this page, candidates have to fill up the required fields given as following:</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Registration ID/ Roll Number/ Name</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Date of Birth</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Father’s Name (In case of searching by name)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Captcha code</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">And Click on&nbsp;<strong>Search</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">After submitting the correct details, applicants will be able to download the Result.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center; padd